{
 "id": "063-saklambac-sayaci",
 "lang": "en",
 "title": "The Hide-and-Seek Counter",
 "theme": "Counting honestly in hide-and-seek and fair rules for everyone",
 "blurb": "The friends play hide-and-seek at the park, but Elif's wheels sink into the sand and she is always found first. Elif takes a deep breath and suggests two new rules for the game. And Ali, the seeker, never peeks, however curious he gets.",
 "voiceNames": {
  "ali": "Ali",
  "zeynep": "Zeynep",
  "can": "Can",
  "elif": "Elif"
 },
 "pages": [
  {
   "text": "Hide-and-seek time at the park! Ali was the seeker. He turned to the tree and shut his eyes tight. Curiosity tickled his nose, but Ali didn't peek through his fingers. “One, two, three, four, five, six, seven! Ready or not, here I come!”",
   "hits": {
    "ali": {
     "say": "No peeking! Ready or not, here I come!"
    },
    "zeynep": {
     "say": "Run, run! Ali's counting!"
    },
    "elif": {
     "say": "Whizz! I'm hiding too!"
    }
   },
   "mech": {
    "done": "Seven! Ali is opening his eyes!",
    "msg": "You counted to seven!"
   },
   "hint": "Count with Ali!",
   "ask": "Ali was really curious, but he didn't peek. Why do you think that is? How do you count when you're the seeker?"
  },
  {
   "text": "Zeynep ran to the slide, Can to the bush. Elif pushed her wheels, whizz! But the wheels sank into the sand. “Found you, Elif!” said Ali. Elif had been found first again. She felt so sad, her throat went tight.",
   "hits": {
    "ali": {
     "say": "Found you, Elif! Found you again!"
    },
    "elif": {
     "say": "My wheels sank into the sand…"
    },
    "can": {
     "say": "Shhh! He didn't see me."
    }
   },
   "hint": "Touch Elif!",
   "ask": "Why is Elif always found first? How do you think she feels right now?"
  },
  {
   "text": "Elif took a deep breath. In through her nose, out through her mouth. The tightness in her throat melted away. Then her eyes lit up. “Wait! Let's change this game for everyone. I have an idea!”",
   "hits": {
    "elif": {
     "say": "Wait! I have an idea!"
    },
    "zeynep": {
     "say": "An idea? Tell us, tell us!"
    },
    "ali": {
     "say": "We're listening, Elif."
    }
   },
   "predict": {
    "q": "What do you think Elif's idea is?",
    "res": "Come on, let's listen to Elif!",
    "opts": [
     {
      "l": "New hiding places"
     },
     {
      "l": "A new home base"
     }
    ]
   },
   "hint": "Touch Elif!",
   "ask": "How do you calm down when you're sad? Come on, let's take a breath like Elif."
  },
  {
   "text": "“Rule one: no hiding in the sand, sand swallows wheels!” said Elif. “Rule two: home base is this bench. Everyone can get there easily!” Ali smiled. “And even if I'm curious, I'll never peek. Promise!”",
   "hits": {
    "elif": {
     "say": "No hiding in the sand!"
    },
    "ali": {
     "say": "Even if I'm curious, I won't peek. Promise!"
    },
    "can": {
     "say": "These rules work for everyone!"
    },
    "kum": {
     "say": "Sand swallows wheels!"
    }
   },
   "hint": "Touch the new home base!",
   "ask": "What were Elif's two rules? Why is the bench a good home base? Which rule would you add?"
  },
  {
   "text": "The game started again. Ali counted to seven and didn't peek once. Then he searched, softly, softly. That bush is wiggling! Over there, a hairband is shining! But where is Elif?",
   "hits": {
    "ali": {
     "say": "Where could you all be?"
    },
    "can": {
     "say": "Hic! You found me!"
    },
    "zeynep": {
     "say": "Oh! My hairband gave me away!"
    }
   },
   "mech": {
    "done": "You found two of them! But where is Elif?",
    "msg": "What a great seeker!"
   },
   "hint": "Find the hiders!",
   "ask": "Where did Can and Zeynep hide? Where would you hide at the park?"
  },
  {
   "text": "Elif came out from behind the slide. Whizz, whizz, whizz! Ali ran, but Elif was faster. She put her hand on the bench: “Home free!” Everyone clapped. Elif's heart fluttered. Now the game was everyone's game.",
   "hits": {
    "elif": {
     "say": "Home free! I made it!"
    },
    "ali": {
     "say": "I never peeked! You won, Elif!"
    },
    "zeynep": {
     "say": "Hooray! Let's play again!"
    }
   },
   "mech": {
    "say": "Whizz, whizz, whizz, whizz!",
    "done": "Home free! Elif reached the bench!",
    "msg": "Elif made it!"
   },
   "hint": "Touch Elif so she speeds up!",
   "ask": "How did the game change with the new rules? Why do you think everyone is happy?",
   "cues": [
    {
     "w": 26,
